    ],
    "text": "APPOINTMENT OF DISTRICT OPIUM BOARDS UNDER THE OPIUM ORDINANCE IN 1910,AS AMENDED BY THE POISONS, OPIUM AND DANGEROUS DRUGS ORDINANCENo. 17 OF 1929",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      469.09,
      546.4,
      504.16
    ],
    "text": "IN terms of the powers vested in me under the Section 42 (2) of the Poisons, Opium and Dangerous Drugs OrdinanceNo. 17 of 1929 (Chapter 549), I, Rajitha Senarathna, Minister of Health, Nutrition and Indigenous Medicine do herebyamend the Opium Board constituted for Badulla District as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      517.09,
      546.46,
      576.16
    ],
    "text": "Accordingly, Dr. (Mrs.) R. M. C. Janaki Ekanayake who was appointed as member of the District Opium Boardin the Badulla District by Gazette Extraordinary No. 1638/6 and dated 25.01.2010 has been replaced by Dr. (Mrs.)Nirupa Sanjeewani Ratnayake.DR. RAJITHA SENARATHNA,Minister of Health, Nutrition and Indigenous Medicine.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
